## 10. Gacha System

### State
```json
{"uid":"...","mikuPoint":0,"pity":0,"pityThreshold":30,"costs":{"single":90,"multi":600}}
```

### Shop
- 22 banner items, all cost 300 MP
- SSR/Rare rarity system
- Video + thumbnail assets

### Exploit Attempts
- Free spin:  Server validates MP balance
- Price manipulation:  Server ignores client price
- Cost bypass:  Server checks balance server-side

