## 12. Rank Title System

### Logic (Hardcoded in APK)
```
if isVip == false → "Miku Rookie"
if isVip == true  → "Miku Premium"
```

### Only 2 Possible Titles
- Server calculates from `isVip` field
- No way to change rank title without VIP status
- `isVip` is server-controlled

---

## 13. Admin Endpoints (Blocked)

### Enumerated (18+ paths from ga.smali)
```
/admin/notifications/broadcast
/admin/notifications/send
/admin/analytics
/admin/config
/admin/users
/admin/grant-premium
/admin/grant-vip
/admin/grant-badge
/admin/grant-points
```

### Status
- Nginx 403 on most paths
- App-level role check: `ADMIN_ROLE_REQUIRED`
- Cannot bypass with headers (X-Forwarded-For, etc.)
- Need `role=admin` in database

